    "reason": "[ev-2214fc54500d] and [ev-77f05428497a] say only that the NPDS metric is now exported under a new name. No Helm value, flag, field or setting is involved. An environment is exposed only if something outside Cilium still queries the old name, such as dashboards, alerts or recording rules, often in external monitoring systems. The evidence names no product configuration that would show this, so the undecidable leaf, which asks which consumers query the old metric name, is a fair exposure condition.",
